    "description": {
      "value": "<p data-start=\"3260\" data-end=\"3274\"><em data-start=\"3260\" data-end=\"3274\">(14th Level)</em></p><p><strong>Administrative Pressure:</strong> −1</p><p data-start=\"3276\" data-end=\"3328\">You help communities absorb change without breaking.</p><h3 data-start=\"3330\" data-end=\"3340\">Effect</h3><ul data-start=\"3341\" data-end=\"3450\"><li data-start=\"3341\" data-end=\"3364\"><p data-start=\"3343\" data-end=\"3364\">Reduce drift fallout.</p></li><li data-start=\"3365\" data-end=\"3392\"><p data-start=\"3367\" data-end=\"3392\">Soften minority pressure.</p></li><li data-start=\"3393\" data-end=\"3450\"><p data-start=\"3395\" data-end=\"3450\">Stabilize unity during ideological or political stress.</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"3452\" data-end=\"3511\">You do not erase disagreement.<br data-start=\"3482\" data-end=\"3485\" />You prevent fragmentation.</p><h3 data-start=\"3513\" data-end=\"3521\">Cost</h3><p data-start=\"3522\" data-end=\"3547\">Spend 1 Civic Charge die.</p><h3 data-start=\"3549\" data-end=\"3566\">Clarification</h3><p data-start=\"3567\" data-end=\"3637\">Integration Charter strengthens cohesion without enforcing uniformity.</p><h3 data-start=\"3639\" data-end=\"3651\">Pushback</h3><p data-start=\"3652\" data-end=\"3728\">Overuse can create artificial harmony that suppresses needed transformation.</p>",
